&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;発行済株式&lt;br/&gt;(自己株式を&lt;br/&gt;除く。)の&lt;br/&gt;総数に対する&lt;br/&gt;所有株式数&lt;br/&gt;の割合(％)&lt;/p&gt;
